  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). No StrategyWiki page under \"Mafia: Definitive Edition\" or \"Mafia (2020)\". mafiagame.fandom.com answers the API, with about 45 linked pages; names only were looked at, nothing copied. 1 of 43 Steam achievements is hidden (\"Not Classy\", 5.9 percent); since every story mission has its own visible achievement, it is unlikely to be a story beat and was put in the driving chapter as a placeholder, which needs checking. The 20 mission achievements name each mission in their descriptions, so the story was split into three parts by mission order (7, 7 and 6 missions); the split points are an arbitrary choice, not act breaks from any source."
